         "\n", "   ", 
        RowBox[{
        "sqText", 
         "[", "\"\<Instead of mapping a, b, c to \[Alpha], \[Beta], \[Gamma], \
the LSTM maps c, b, a to \[Alpha], \[Beta], \[Gamma]. Put the source words at \
